  "authoring": "Project-owned deterministic samples encoded by libtiff 4.7.2, JPEG quality 81, 32-row strips or 64 by 48 tiles. Source value at x,y,component is (13*x + 19*y + 37*c + ((x//7) XOR (y//5))*11) mod 256. Incomplete edge tiles are zero-padded.",
